BEGIN_DESC
TANTRA BETA 12 - Moon, coupling two MPU (demo).
MPU-1 in front, MPU-2 behind it, their coupling pins 1.5 m apart, both facing east. Niza Krit stands beside the gap.
COUPLING: walk to MPU-1's rear bumper (or MPU-2's front) - F "couple with MPU-2". A tow bar joins the pins: a stiff spring with
a damper along it, the pins free to turn - the train jack-knifes in turns, the cars pull and push each other.
DRIVING THE TRAIN: climb onto MPU-1 (F), take its post (F) and drive. MPU-2 has nobody at its post: it follows - the leader's
drive, brakes and parking brake; its wheels steer along the bar so it tracks the leader's path.
UNCOUPLING: F at the coupling again. The coupling is saved in the scenario (the leader keeps its follower).
Keys: W/S/A/D, Shift full power, S service brake, Space emergency brake, B parking brake, Caps Lock deck up/down, V outside view.
END_DESC

